 reach 43,000 studs\n\n👍 Like and join the group for a free unstuck!\n\nCONTROLS:\n\"Space\" - Parking/Emergency Braking\n\"H\" - Honk \n\"L\" - Headlights\n","path":"/game/116094657599018-dangerous-truck-driving","slug":"116094657599018-dangerous-truck-driving","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/31755b8cff1a8d0cca89432a9606192e87fac074c232f1b7c3287554eba29b41.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-4054606280161880e25642a024bd51a1/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":31,"visitor":69733183,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-02-17T23:05:41.525Z","creator":{"name":"The Very Dangerous Group","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":130782443587508,"name":"Dronefront [BALLISTIC]","desc":"Welcome to Dronefront. Choose your side out of 3 teams!\n\n🛡️ Live as an ordinary civilian, surviving drone attacks across towns, villages, and nearby facilities.\n\n🔫 Be a Defender and stand up for your country, using weapons and anti-air defense machines to shoot down incoming drones, earn Fragments and buy better equipment.\n\n🚀 Become a drone operator, launching FPV drones, missiles and strike drones to unleash chaos and destroy key infrastructure such as power plants, barracks, and ammunition storage sites, earning Fragments, to be able to buy better drones and equipment for strikes.\n\nJoin our community server to keep up with new updates on this game! \n\nThis game is a work of fiction created solely for entertainment purposes.\nIt does not replicate, promote, or endorse any real-world wars, conflicts, or political events.","path":"/game/130782443587508-dronefront-ballistic","slug":"130782443587508-dronefront-ballistic","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/7f7eb2d6a5484d588802239dca0cebb3b77f12faf63704beb3fbbc6e4cbe08ad.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-c45a1e675a581dc11c02fe1d0268c2e1/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":31,"visitor":19351238,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-09-11T14:18:43.323Z","creator":{"name":"DEL Interactive","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":4,"freeCount":4,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":11877743732,"name":"Zombie Battle Tycoon🧟","desc":"Leave a like 👍 and favorite ⭐ for more Zombie Battle Tycoon updates! \nZombie Battle Tycoon progress and gamepasses automatically save. 💾 \n\nWelcome to Zombie Battle Tycoon, a comprehensive wave survival game built into a tycoon. \n\nDo you have what it takes to survive?\n\nJOIN INFINITYBATTLES FOR A FREE MAC 10 AND CHECKOUT OUR SOCIAL LINKS BELOW! \nhttps://www.roblox.com/groups/16495000/InfinityBattles#!/about\n\nTags - Zombie, Survival, Tycoon, Undead, Attack, Defense, Call Of Duty Zombies, PS5","path":"/game/11877743732-zombie-battle-tycoon","slug":"11877743732-zombie-battle-tycoon","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/6985553455276b17c68f51e4c24729b334f8d78f8c8d37df6db45f0afa721e53.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-3f8ecee9b96485103068ad364d3d2d34/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":31,"visitor":196206732,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2023-08-10T01:46:58.058Z","creator":{"name":"InfinityBattles","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":135882949571046,"name":"🌌Dream for Brainrots😈","desc":"Welcome to Dream for Brainrots! 🌙✨\n\n😴 Drift off to sleep and enter the Dream World!\n🌌 Explore the dream world and collect Brainrots!\n😈 Save them from the nightmares keeping them trapped\n🏃 Escape before they trap you forever!\n⬇️The deeper you go, the rarer and better the Brainrots get!\nLIKE AND JOIN THE GROUP FOR A REWARD 🌟 \n\n💸 EARNS OFFLINE\n\nTags: Simulator, Cute, Rainbow, Lucky Block, Friends, Rebirth, Brainrot, Speed, Monsters, Fun, Dream, Collect, Memes, Scary, Fast, Tycoon, Colorful, Brainrot Memes, Stars, Pets, Friends, Lucky Block, Raiding","path":"/game/135882949571046-dream-for-brainrots","slug":"135882949571046-dream-for-brainrots","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/5e993faed87f